ight:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">179,200 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic version</a> of <a href=\"/page/Item:Roderic%27s_Wand\" title=\"Item:Roderic&#39;s Wand\">Roderic's Wand</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Summon_Unknown_Monster_II\" title=\"Summon Unknown Monster II\">Summon Unknown Monster II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Summon_Unknown_Monster_II\" title=\"Summon Unknown Monster II\">Summon Unknown Monster II</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 20<br /><b>Charges: </b>6 (6/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 6 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:6)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Summoning\" title=\"Augment Summoning\">Augment Summoning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b> <a href=\"/page/Augment_Summoning\" title=\"Augment Summoning\">Augment Summoning</a></b>: This item grants you the Augment Summoning feat, which gives your summoned creatures +4 to all ability scores, increased health, and increased fortification.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Roderic%27s_Wand.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Roderic%27s_Wand.png/420px-Epic_Roderic%27s_Wand.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"488\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Roderic%27s_Wand.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>This is the unpredictable wand Malicia gave to Roderic, promising that it would protect him. What Roderic did not realize is that the wand recharges over time, but only if not being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><br />\n<p>When cast, it summons one creature at random from this list:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fiendish Troll: CR 10, melee, HP regen, tanky; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_VI\" title=\"Summon Monster VI\">Summon Monster VI</a> spell.</li>\n<li>Summoned Efreet\n<ul><li>CR 12, <a href=\"/page/Lawful_Evil\" title=\"Lawful Evil\">Lawful Evil</a> Outsider</li>\n<li>200 <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">Hit Points</a></li>\n<li>Immune to Fire</li>\n<li>Scimitar +21 <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack roll</a>, 1d8+10 <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">Damage roll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\">Scorching Ray</a>: 19 fire damage</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\">Flaming Sphere</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a>: 8d6 fire damage, <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> 15</li>\n<li>like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_VII\" title=\"Summon Monster VII\">Summon Monster VII</a> spell.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Summoned Bezekira\n<ul><li>CR 14, <a href=\"/page/Lawful_Evil\" title=\"Lawful Evil\">Lawful Evil</a> Outsider</li>\n<li>215 <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">Hit Points</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Spell_Resistance\" title=\"Spell Resistance\">Spell Resistance</a> 21</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> 22</li>\n<li>Claw/Bite +8 <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack roll</a>, 1d10+13 <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">Damage roll</a></li>\n<li>Knockdown <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> 17</li>\n<li>like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_VIII\" title=\"Summon Monster VIII\">Summon Monster VIII</a> spell.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Hezrou Savage: CR 16; like the <a href=\"/page/Summon_Monster_IX\" title=\"Summon Monster IX\">Summon Monster IX</a> spell.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817164955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1762/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15518/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5466/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.349      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   50.349      1 -total\n 92.52%   46.584      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 47.85%   24.094      1 Template:Mat\n 46.14%   23.229      3 Template:Popup\n 13.65%    6.871     24 Template:IO\n 12.99%    6.539      1 Template:Bind\n 10.15%    5.109      1 Template:BgColorVar\n  5.80%    2.921      1 Template:ItemGrantedFeat\n  5.76%    2.902      1 Template:Clicky\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11839-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817164955 and revision id 630348. Ren